<para>Invalid format error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1FormatInvalidError" kindref="compound">FormatInvalidError</ref> represents an error where data does not conform to the expected format or structure.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>FormatInvalidError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>FormatInvalidError(&quot;Malformed<sp/>header<sp/>detected&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
